+// Kept in the existing frame file. A sample is an observation, not a wait span:
+// thread_get_state temporarily stops the target internally, and stack reads
+// occur after it has resumed. Matching registers before/after are reported;
+// they do not make the intervening stack an atomic snapshot.
+namespace nbwait {
